SUMMARY:Third Thursday | DJ Phantom Pantone
DESCRIPTION:Every Third Thursday\, the Museum comes alive with an evening filled with music\, tours\, art making\, special cocktails in our rooftop café\, and more! \nThis month we are featuring a Curator’s Talk | Hidden in Plain View – Art in Southern Appalachia\, with co-creator of Warp\, Weft\, and the Grid\, Kathleen Curtis Wilson from 6–7pm. \nEnjoy an evening of live music with DJ Phantom Pantone on the Museum’s rooftop overlooking Mount Pisgah • Perspective Café and Sculpture Terrace\, level 4 \nRESERVE TICKETS NOW
