SUMMARY:Summer Art Camp | Fun with Fiber Art (Rising K - 2nd grade)
DESCRIPTION:JOIN THE WAITLIST \nLearn to weave\, felt with wool\, collage with paper and much more during this week focusing on fiber art! Students will explore different materials and methods of creating artworks with yarn\, thread\, fabric\, and more!  \nMeet the Instructor: M Rathsack\nM Rathsack\, owner and instructor at M’s School of Art\, has taught many mediums in many locations for all ages in Western North Carolina since 2006. She creates her own art as the Dancing Potter working primarily as a decorative raku potter. 
URL:https://www.ashevilleart.org/event/summer-art-camp-fun-with-fiber-art-rising-k-2nd-grade-3/
LOCATION:NC
CATEGORIES:Summer Art Camp
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.ashevilleart.org/wp-content/uploads/2014.37.34_verso-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
